{"ID":"20240205170446-3l1777f","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205170446-3l1777f","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205170446-3l1777f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206135438-hqkgw8o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205170630-kbrnuhd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206135438-hqkgw8o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:182,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:182\u0026#125;","title":"土荆皮","type":"doc","updated":"20240830163140"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206135438-hqkgw8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135438-hqkgw8o","updated":"20240206135447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产浙江、江苏、安徽、湖南、福建等地。\n【性状】\t本品根皮呈不规则的长条状，扭曲而稍卷，大小不一，厚2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5mm。外表面灰黄色，粗糙，有皱纹及灰白色横向皮孔，粗皮常呈鳞片状剥落，剥落处红棕色。内表面黄棕色至红棕色，平坦，有细致的纵向纹理。质韧，折断面呈裂片状，可层层剥离。气微，味苦而涩。树皮呈板片状，厚约至8mm，粗皮较厚，外表面龟裂状，内表面较粗糙。\n【性味】\t辛，温，有毒。\n【功效】\t杀虫，止痒。用于疥癣瘙痒。"}]},{"ID":"20240206135438-ntp8wny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135438-ntp8wny","updated":"20240206135438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206135438-6mn6ec8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710170212-ghzg3md","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710170212-ghzg3md","updated":"20240710170212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 461px;","style":"width: 451px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"土荆皮"},{"Type":"NodeClose